# Security-owned paths. With a code-owner review required on main and
# feature/**, a change to the rules, the droids, the judge, the pipeline, the
# tests or the infrastructure needs an approval from the account below, who is
# not the author. This is the second layer against a fix that games its own
# test or checks; the verifier is the first.
/AGENTS.md          @garymax-cloud
/Makefile           @garymax-cloud
/.factory/          @garymax-cloud
/.github/           @garymax-cloud
/scripts/           @garymax-cloud
/tests/             @garymax-cloud
/infra/             @garymax-cloud
/requirements.txt   @garymax-cloud
